  neither          no angular channel at all; nine pair-graph convolutions (manuscript Table 3, arm B)
  line graph       angles as ALIGNN input features, no angular objective (manuscript Table 3, arm A; = A0)
  angle diffusion  the angular denoising objective with no line graph: triplets are built and supervised, but no message travels along one, so the coupling to coordinates is through the shared trunk's gradient only
  both             angles as features and as a denoised variable, coupled through angles -> bonds -> atoms (= A3, the proposed model)

